      "extract": "The generalized Langevin equation (GLE) is an important mathematical tool for investigating a wide class of both quantum and classical diffusive phenomena [1] and it is an extension of the Langevin equation [2]. The major advantage of GLE-based approaches is the reduction of the number of degrees of freedom which describe the system-environment interactions. For example, in case of a particle moving in a given",
